{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0414_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "45144e6ef73ec02d7a2b12f4fffbe44826839c6818cb50f844819cc53efac62e", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん！\n今、ちょっとだけお時間いいですか？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生！\n现在方便占用您一点时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0414_1003_p", "source_sha256": "aad27a32f7c58189e0466f21e2cd6a2b75f5be98b88dcac8f5d00cff294e9d5c", "ja": "春香か。丁度休憩しようと思ってたところだから\n大丈夫だよ。ってあれ？　その服は……", "zh": "是春香啊。我正好想休息一下，\n没问题的。咦？那件衣服是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0414_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "de3a40c19fa80f82cfe91683ae23ffae14a032ccdb4f6443c250c17eceb00ae0", "ja": "あ、気づいちゃいましたか？　えへへ♪\n新しい服、買っちゃいました。", "zh": "啊，被你发现了？嘿嘿♪\n我买了套新衣服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0414_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "5beeb4fd1c76d050050a149b2b7a71284d4391c04bfb9a59669864e61fc2b252", "ja": "お仕事の時も着られる服を\nと思って選んだんですけど……どうですか？", "zh": "我是想着选一件工作时也能穿的衣服……你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0414_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0bdfecd99093afb37cad4e0689822cd36a4123db42de5a49628d6a110e081745", "ja": "すごくいいと思うよ！　可愛らしい\n雰囲気が、髪型にもよく合っていると思う。", "zh": "我觉得非常棒！可爱的\n感觉也和发型很相称。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0414_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "4dbb98bb863f817aec8499040580b5d96a599cab477d5325b08fa60c92db0437", "ja": "本当ですか？　やったー♪\nやっぱり、見せに来てよかったぁ……。", "zh": "真的吗？太好了♪\n果然还是来给你看看比较好……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0414_1008_p", "source_sha256": "048a44eae0b573617aca8df395a98067b98871db746e8b1a3ee1f54a0e8251f3", "ja": "うん？　どういうことだ？", "zh": "嗯？这话是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0414_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "17223681636937b5ff9146d6b7f38a7b520e808a0a9da9c6cfe1c05666e8f872", "ja": "あ、えっと……。この服、自分では気に入ってたんです\nけど。他の人から見たらどうなのかなって思って……。", "zh": "啊，那个……这件衣服，我自己还是挺喜欢的。\n只是，我在想，从别人眼里看会是什么样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0414_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "5c580c62c26696e898f92129fcbc729325e857fa8abe65c9c5a51f6c6399ed6f", "ja": "でも、衣装ってわけじゃないですし。\n見てもらうのは、もしかしたら迷惑かもって……。", "zh": "不过，这也不算是演出服。让别人看到的话，说不定会给人添麻烦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0414_1011_p", "source_sha256": "3a44c8537811b053a84e86f21a149d8a9c976111a63ea035f68becf9af2a8772", "ja": "なんだ、そんなことを考えてたのか。\nそんなの、全然気にしなくてもいいのに。", "zh": "原来你一直在想这种事啊。\n这种事完全不用在意嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0414_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "a45cb8b9d92f8850732e553b9b384bc355cbc86439f5057caf02fa57196e3d7c", "ja": "でも……。", "zh": "可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0414_1013_p", "source_sha256": "6dc1b8bb77daf45015cdbb881dc132c8354aa8435a236d03b78103f6f10c61f6", "ja": "俺は春香のプロデューサーだろ？\nそれは、春香の仲間ってことだから。", "zh": "我不是春香的制作人吗？\n因为那也就是说，我是春香的伙伴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0414_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "a3c6d04d0ef81a445941760940e6db2d2ef00d701032edbd6b0454990c302cac", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nえへへ、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生……。\n嘿嘿，谢谢你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0414_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "383006aae11df5c8b0e38edcf3914abb306b32a34f9df5463d52a32eb361d342", "ja": "そっか、仲間かぁ……！\nそれなら、遠慮しすぎたら変ですよね。ふふっ！", "zh": "这样啊，是伙伴呀……！\n那样的话，要是太见外了反而奇怪吧。呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0414_1016_p", "source_sha256": "b218d8ecd951ddda6e6d0d1950b70dcbd84c37d8b0d2d40ba2cc17dd1b87df59", "ja": "そうそう、そういうこと。", "zh": "对对，就是这么回事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0414_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "0118d1cf9b4228614539c6d2446432ff0432dc7dc8b1dbbf5bed4a6592886610", "ja": "それじゃあ……次また買い物をした時も、\n見てもらっていいですか？", "zh": "那么……下次买东西的时候，也能帮我看看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0414_1018_001har", "source_sha256": "9d6333ff6b5c1544441e341ff5f12263337f30c173bc1156c782211932a7ddf7", "ja": "あ、できれば一緒にお店に行って選んでもらえると、\nもっと嬉しいですけど……なんて。", "zh": "啊，如果可以的话，要是能一起去店里帮我挑选，我会更开心的……开玩笑的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0414_1019_p", "source_sha256": "f5d2f143de8883f7ff5a3f8f144457f81dc20ca8857ae8d80ce2bb9e1f6851ba", "ja": "もちろん。たいして役に立てないかもしれないけど\n俺でよければ、いつでも付き合うよ。", "zh": "当然可以。虽然可能帮不上什么大忙，\n但只要你不嫌弃，我随时奉陪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0414_1020_001har", "source_sha256": "431bd944c46bd9b633e427c73ccde98c0514e3f4357465b4804e083617aac68c", "ja": "わぁ♪　それじゃ、\n早速次のお休みにお願いしていいですか！？", "zh": "哇♪　那，\n可以麻烦您就定在下次休息日吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0414_1021_001har", "source_sha256": "a4cf72182b46c03677ff99a5357947ca08fec75640b83077b64167535b563b2c", "ja": "実は、この服に合わせた小物を買うか迷ってたんです。\n{$P$}さんにも見て欲しくって！", "zh": "其实，我正拿不定主意要不要买跟这身衣服搭的小配饰呢。\n所以想让{$P$}先生也帮我看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
